      "updated": 1758790800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Local notes: the stub payment provider never calls back — send steps 2 and 3's callbacks yourself (see requests.http). Step 5's dormancy can be forced with account.mark_dormant_accounts(). Step 6 pays into the MAIN account, so step 5 closes a separate SAVINGS account.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Local notes: the stub payment provider never calls back — send steps 2 and 3's callbacks yourself (see requests.http). Step 5's dormancy can be forced with account.mark_dormant_accounts(). Step 6 pays into the MAIN account, so step 5 closes a separate SAVINGS account.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
